    <bpmn:process id="W_W3028" name="W3028. Claim Evidence Package, Liability Determination &amp; Valuation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Claim filed or pre-filing preparation
Frequency: Per claim
Volume: Enterprise claims
Owner: Claims Analyst
Participants: Claims Analyst, Inventory Control, Finance, Legal
Source: workflow W3028 — Claim Evidence Package, Liability Determination &amp; Valuation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3028_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3028_Lane1" name="Claims Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3028_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3028_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3028_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3028_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3028_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3028_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3028_Start4" name="Claim filed or pre-filing preparation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3028_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3028_Task5" name="Claims Analyst assembles evidence package: damage case, photos, PO/ASN…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Claims Analyst assembles evidence package: damage case, photos, PO/ASN, waybill, survey, QC report, correspondence — per claim type template
Responsible (R): Claims Analyst
Accountable (A): Claims Manager
Duration: Per claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3028_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3028_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3028_Task6" name="Claims Analyst/Inventory Control determine liability split where shared (vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Claims Analyst/Inventory Control determine liability split where shared (vendor vs. carrier vs. self); document apportionment and rationale
Responsible (R): Claims Analyst / Inventory Control
Accountable (A): Claims Manager
Duration: Per claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3028_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3028_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3028_Task7" name="Finance values claim at landed cost + attributable handling/logistics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance values claim at landed cost + attributable handling/logistics; validates against recovery potential and materiality threshold
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Per claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3028_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3028_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3028_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3028_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-500 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor, Carrier &amp; Freight Claims Filing &amp; Resolution (PA-90.2).) | - operational: landed-cost-based valuation template
Owner: Claims Analyst</bpmn:text>
