    <bpmn:process id="W_W3030" name="W3030. Subrogation, Insurance Recovery &amp; Dual-Claim Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Claim settlement short of full recovery, or insured event
Frequency: Per qualifying claim
Volume: Subset of high-value claims
Owner: Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Participants: Risk/Insurance, Claims Mgr, Finance, Legal, Broker
Source: workflow W3030 — Subrogation, Insurance Recovery &amp; Dual-Claim Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
