      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly/monthly reporting
Frequency: Weekly + monthly
Volume: Enterprise open claims
Owner: Claims Manager
Participants: Claims Mgr, Supply Chain Analytics, Vendor Mgmt, Logistics, Finance
Source: workflow W3032 — Vendor/Carrier Claim Aging, Recovery Analytics &amp; Scorecard Feed</bpmn:documentation>
